.codebuddy/

# TaskFlow：个人规则为本地工作规则，永不提交（TaskFlow 规定）
# 任务文档（TaskFlowDocs/<task-id>/、todo.md、achieved/）与仓库级索引 index.md 均进 git
TaskFlowDocs/repository-docs/*.md
!TaskFlowDocs/repository-docs/index.md

# Local
pnpm-workspace.yaml
